# FileMetadata

|Class Info|
|:-----------------------------------------------|
|public class FileMetadata 文件的元数据，不支持目录的元数据的相关操作。|

## Method Summary

|Qualifier and Type|Method Name and Description|
|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|String|[getBucket](#section12529499362)() 获取存储实例名。|
|String|[getCTime](#section5205104516385)() 获取文件创建时间。|
|String|[getMTime](#section5919133919397)() 获取文件修改时间。|
|String|[getName](#section21131019184013)() 获取云端文件名。|
|String|[getPath](#section1276911715413)() 获取云端文件路径。|
|Long|[getSize](#section17907173104214)() 获取云端文件大小。|
|String|[getSHA256Hash](#section19599346194818)() 获取上传文件时设置的SHA256。|
|String|[getContentType](#section226125020425)() 获取云端文件类型。|
|String|[getCacheControl](#section5168054193518)() 获取用户设置的CacheControl设置。|
|String|[getContentDisposition](#section177991869389)() 获取用户设置的ContentDisposition设置。|
|String|[getContentEncoding](#section7466152920386)() 获取用户设置的ContentEncoding设置。|
|String|[getContentLanguage](#section62684536384)() 获取用户设置的ContentLanguage设置。|
|Map<String, String>|[getCustomMetadata](#section179546354712)() 获取自定义的云端文件属性。|
|void|[setSHA256Hash](#section9484324205013)(String sha256) 设置上传文件的SHA256。|
|void|[setContentType](#section11175112874811)(String contentType) 设置标准HTTP头部的ContentType类型。|
|void|[setCacheControl](#section86587173395)(String cacheControl) 设置标准HTTP头部的CacheControl设置。|
|void|[setContentDisposition](#section8595153024016)(String contentDisposition) 设置标准HTTP头部的ContentDisposition设置。|
|void|[setContentEncoding](#section171311839124112)(String contentEncoding) 设置标准HTTP头部的ContentEncoding设置。|
|void|[setContentLanguage](#section173634534216)(String contentLanguage) 设置标准HTTP头部的ContentLanguage设置。|
|void|[setCustomMetadata](#section12686485503)(Map<String, String> metadata) 设置自定义的云端文件属性。|
|[StorageReference](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/storagereference-0000001054767243)|[getStorageReference](#section15627839115115)() 返回文件或目录的引用。|

